  "previous_findings_status": [
    { "id": "review-spec-conformance-1-1", "status": "RESOLVED", "note": "DEC-6 accepted the behaviour and added AC-10 to story.md and spec.md. The fix diff adds SoftDeleteResourceTypeReadPathTests.GetResourceInstances_IncludeDeletedForSoftDeletedType_ReturnsPropertyValuesWithDefinitionNames, tagged [Trait(\"AC\",\"AC-10\")]. The test would fail if AC-10 were violated. If definitions of soft-deleted schemas were filtered out, GetResourceInstancesQueryHandler.cs:72-73 would fall back to string.Empty, and the test's Assert.Equal(\"Seats\", seats.PropertyName) / Assert.Equal(nameof(PropertyDataType.Number), seats.DataType) at SoftDeleteResourceTypeReadPathTests.cs:96-97 would fail. If the soft-deleted instance were not listed, Assert.Single at :88 would fail. The local record shapes match PropertyValueResult(PropertyDefinitionId, PropertyName, DataType, Value) and ResourceInstanceRowDto. ac-matrix maps AC-10 to this test." },
    { "id": "review-spec-conformance-1-2", "status": "STILL_OPEN", "note": "The weakness has not changed: the recording broker still does not check at record time that the row exists, and the fix diff does not touch ResourceLifecycleEventTests. The owner closed the finding by decision DEC-7 ('Accept for this story; make the order a deterministic check later'). It stays open only as the recorded, accepted gap and does not block." },
    { "id": "review-spec-conformance-1-3", "status": "STILL_OPEN", "note": "OPINION, non-blocking. The fix diff does not touch the coverlet.collector additions in the ManagementGroups/Users integration test csproj files." }
